# Green Ward's "This effect doesn't remove this Aura" spares it from its own protection only: another instance of
# protection from green still removes it once it is green (CR 702.16n, 704.5m). Green Ward enchants a creature, any
# player's (CR 303.4a): Bot1 cannot cast it on its Mox Jet (the refusal) but enchants Bot2's Coast Watcher, which has
# protection from green of its own. While the Ward is white it stays; Painter's Servant naming green makes it green
# (CR 105.3), and the Watcher's protection puts it into Bot1's graveyard.

